703	Since only admissible field sizes $q = 2^k$ arise in the Pauli basis test, the
704	maximally entangled state $\ket{\mathrm{EPR}_q}$ and the qudit Pauli
705	projectors are isomorphic to tensor products of qubit EPR states
706	$\ket{\mathrm{EPR}_2}$ and qubit Pauli projectors. This is the content of the
707	next lemma, which is what allows the Pauli basis test to self-test Pauli
708	observables and maximally entangled states over \emph{qubits}
709	(Chapter~\ref{chap:qpbt-test}).
